  "sourceTitle": "Skewered Chicken",
  "sourceText": "Skewered Chicken\nBy: Rach\nPublished: Wednesday, December 9, 2009 - 11:49pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 lb Boneless chicken \n1 tablespoon soy sauce\n3 tablespoons chili powder\n2 tablespoons lemon juice\n2 tablespoons ginger-garlic paste\n1 cube chicken bouillon\n1/2 teaspoon garam masala powder\n1 tablespoon yogurt\n1/4 cup butter\n1/4 teaspoon Salt to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Dice the boneless chicken into cubes. Marinade for 48 hours with all ingredients except butter. 2 Skewer the chicken. Barbecue on hot charcoal grill.\n\nAbout\n\n\nServe hot with salads.",
